        <span class="field-validation-valid" data-valmsg-for="fxb.f7dc6868-ff6c-4f6f-91f5-2e2da7895112.Fields[8fda61c3-22a8-4885-a9b7-36dfa2d47424].Value" data-valmsg-replace="true"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group" id="divLabel" style="display: none">
        <p class="EUYes">I understand that if I am an European Union (&ldquo;EU&rdquo;) resident individual (i.e. my residential address is based in any of the EU countries), I can refer to Prudential Privacy Notice (which is available at <a rel="noopener noreferrer" href="/Privacy-Notice" target="_blank" style="color: blue;">https://www.prudential.com.sg/privacy-notice</a>) for more information on the rights available to me under the GDPR.</p>
